{"title":"The Emberfang's Heart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Emberfang&#39;s Heart is a named <a href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">Emberfang&#39;s Heart</a> seen at level 65–68.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Emberfang&#39;s Heart</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 8×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6305\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-emberfang-s-heart\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/42f74c164b26deff4eb1.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/heartbreaker-warmace\"><b>Heartbreaker</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Titanium Warmace, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+3% damage for each hit in a row on the same target, up to +15%.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1d2e48e084e8ea17357b.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/last-ember-longbow\"><b>The Last Ember</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Critical hits set the target and up to 4 other monsters within 1.5 tiles of it burning.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4b10a1b4003b700566bc.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/keepers-sluice-staff\"><b>The Keeper&#39;s Sluice</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Your spells cast 8% faster.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9f21d42474f8d7e3fe4d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/639e656beda54ecb8321.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/32c045dadd9ca37ea76c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5e68e9d0b6af82b39346.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Emberfang&#39;s Heart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">Emberfang&#39;s Heart</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>65–68</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>6,899</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>40 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}